Fix flawed [MSC4311](https://github.com/matrix-org/matrix-spec-proposals/pull/4311) partial implementation introduced in Synapse v1.136.0 for invites/knocks: client-side API's like `/sync` use [stripped state events](https://spec.matrix.org/v1.18/client-server-api/#stripped-state) and we now send full PDUs on the federation-side. To allow some time for the ecosystem to adapt and support MSC4311, Synapse will only apply strict validation when receiving invites/knocks after 2027-06-01.
